# What is tracked here is the *project*: the .wwu work units and the .wproj,
# which are text, diff usefully, and are the only part anybody authors.
#
# Everything below is either generated from those, or media that does not belong
# in a git repo at this size (Originals alone is 1.4 GB, most of it the BOOM and
# Audiokinetic convolution IR libraries, which are licensed downloads rather than
# anything made here).
#
# The consequence worth knowing: a fresh clone has the project but not the audio
# it points at, so SoundBank generation will fail on the missing sources until
# the libraries are reinstalled and the piece's own recordings are put back under
# Originals/SFX (their downloads are in ../audio).
Originals/
GeneratedSoundBanks/
.cache/

# Per-machine, rewritten constantly, and named for the machine that wrote them.
*.validationcache
*.wsettings
